namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamMeshModifierWarp {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierWarp.h#DreamMeshModifierWarp
    src   "Bends what a visual draws: an image, a rect block, a text, a line -- any batch mesh. The mesh is first cut finer, the\npieces no longer than Cell Length, then every vertex is moved by a named warp style or a Bezier lattice. Every texture\ncoordinate is carried along, so a rect block's corners, a glyph's distance field and an image's pixels bend with the\nmesh; clipping and masks are measured where the pixels end up, and a visual set to hit test by its mesh (Raycast Type\nMesh or Visible Pixel) is hit where the bent triangles are.\n\nOn a text, every glyph is cut by itself: the style names and their Bend and distortions are those of the image editors'\ntext warp, so a document's warp maps here by name. It runs after the modifiers that work on characters (a text\nanimation, text on a path) and before those that copy the mesh (a shadow follows the bent text).\n\nAt rest -- no bend, no distortion, an unmoved lattice -- it changes nothing and costs nothing."
    text  "弯曲视觉对象绘制的内容：图像、矩形块、文本、线条——任意合批网格。首先将网格切分得更细，使每块\n不超过单元长度，然后由指定的扭曲样式或贝塞尔晶格移动每个顶点。所有纹理\n坐标都会随之传递，因此矩形块的角、字形的距离场和图像的像素都会随网格一起\n弯曲；裁剪和遮罩按像素最终所在的位置计算，设置为按网格进行命中测试（Raycast Type\n为 Mesh 或 Visible Pixel）的视觉对象，会在弯曲后的三角形所在位置被命中。\n\n对于文本，每个字形单独切分：样式名称及其 Bend 和扭曲参数与图像编辑器的\n文本扭曲一致，因此文档中的扭曲可按名称映射到此处。它在作用于字符的修改器（文本\n动画、路径文本）之后运行，在复制网格的修改器（阴影会跟随弯曲后的文本）之前运行。\n\n静止状态下——无弯曲、无扭曲、晶格未移动——它不产生任何变化，也不产生任何开销。"
    state machine
}

DreamMeshModifierWarp:Bend {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierWarp.h#DreamMeshModifierWarp:Bend
    src   "How far the style bends, -100 to 100 percent; a negative bend bends the other way."
    text  "样式弯曲的程度，-100% 到 100%；负值会向相反方向弯曲。"
    state machine
}

DreamMeshModifierWarp:Bounds {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierWarp.h#DreamMeshModifierWarp:Bounds
    src   "The box the warp bends: what the visual draws, or the widget's rect."
    text  "扭曲所作用的框：视觉对象绘制的内容，或控件的矩形。"
    state machine
}

DreamMeshModifierWarp:CellLength {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierWarp.h#DreamMeshModifierWarp:CellLength
    src   "The longest side a piece of the cut mesh may have, in local units. Smaller bends more smoothly and costs more vertices."
    text  "切分后的网格块可能具有的最长边长，使用局部单位。值越小，弯曲越平滑，但消耗的顶点越多。"
    state machine
}

DreamMeshModifierWarp:HorizontalDistortion {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierWarp.h#DreamMeshModifierWarp:HorizontalDistortion
    src   "-100 to 100 percent: a perspective along the length, the right end the larger one when positive."
    text  "-100% 到 100%：沿长度方向的透视，为正值时右端更大。"
    state machine
}

DreamMeshModifierWarp:IsAtRest {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierWarp.h#DreamMeshModifierWarp:IsAtRest
    src   "Whether the warp moves nothing now: no style bend or distortion, or a lattice at rest."
    text  "变形当前是否不产生任何移动：没有样式弯曲或扭曲，或晶格处于静止状态。"
    state machine
}

